# Official campaign under fitness5

Every slot of the official plan (`OfficialPack`: same recipes, tiers, cycles, planned rings, no mechanics, seed 7, 400 tries, x2 on tier >= 2, same director seeds) got a new candidate selected by fitness5 with the tier floors (`Fitness5Config`, id c80a0f57; `select5v`, the queue repair competing with the unrepaired level) at the belt of `beltFor` (10 on tier 0 and cycles 1-2 except 12 / 16 on tiers 2 / 3 there; else 14 / 16 / 20 on tiers 1 / 2 / 3). The 20 slots of the rebuild preview were not regenerated: their levels come from `rebuild-preview-levels.json` and were re-measured here.

**Keep or replace.** The shipped level and the candidate are measured the same way (long chain x16, order dependence over 64 draws at 200000 nodes, intended + solver line, the solver line at 3M nodes). The shipped level stays unless the candidate is strictly better in the selection's order: passes the base gates and floors, then fewer failed floors, then fitness5 closer to the recipe target (higher on max recipes). When both pass, the candidate must get at least 2.0 closer to the target (fewer needless replacements). A candidate must also be solved by `Solver.solve(level, 2M)`. Ties keep the shipped level.

Commit 8ce5435-dirty. CPU time over the slots 95979 s (26.7 h); runs: 2026-10-18T05:50:51.840805Z slots 4 threads 4 wall 66 s commit 8ce5435-dirty; 2026-10-18T09:14:41.894625Z slots 96 threads 8 wall 12176 s commit 8ce5435-dirty.

**90 slots replaced, 10 kept.**

